[{"code":"prerender_needs_data","severity":"error","span":{"file":"beni.json","start":{"line":1,"col":1},"end":{"line":1,"col":1}},"title":"PRERENDER NEEDS DATA","message":"This program says `Browser.prerenderData`, so each of its pages is made from a\nvalue a data program gives, and this project names no data program.\n\nAdd one to `\"build\"`: `\"data\": { \"paths\": [\"data\", \"shared\"] }`, the paths of a\nprogram built for `node` whose `main` is `Prerender.pages`\n(`docs/design/prerender.md` §8.2, §8.3)."}]
